    <body>
Apakah kamu sudah pernah makan mi <segment id='1' features='eror;ejaan;ejsp' state='active' comment='Kelebihan spasi' correction='goreng?'>goreng ?</segment> Foto ini adalah foto mi <segment id='37' features='eror;ejaan;ejhrf' state='active' correction='goreng'>goremg</segment>. <segment id='3' features='eror;gramatikal;kalimat;kalpen' state='active' correction='Mi goreng sangat terkenal, tetapi kurang terkenal dibandingkan dengan nasi goreng.'>Mi <segment id='2' features='eror;ejaan;ejhrf' state='active' correction='goreng' parent='3'>goren</segment> sangat terkenal. Tetapi <segment id='38' features='eror;gramatikal;frasa-nomina;nomx' state='active' comment='Nomina sudah ada di awal karena penggabungan kalimat' parent='3'>mi goreng</segment> kurang terkenal <segment id='39' features='eror;gramatikal;frasa-preposisi;prep0' state='active' correction='dengan' parent='3'><segment id='4' features='eror;ejaan;ejhrf' state='active' parent='39'>dibangingkan</segment> nasi</segment> goreng.</segment>
Anda bisa makan mi goreng di mana-mana. Mi goreng adalah mi yang digoreng <segment id='6' features='eror;leksikal;kata;preps' state='active' correction='dengan'>dan</segment> <segment id='5' features='eror;gramatikal;konjungsi;konj0' state='active' correction='dan'>bumbu-bumbu <segment id='10' features='eror;ejaan;ejsp' state='active' comment='Kekurangan spasi' correction='terasi. Mi'><segment id='9' features='eror;ejaan;ejsp' state='active' comment='Kelebihan spasi' correction='terasi.' parent='10'>terasi</segment> .</segment><segment id='7' features='eror;leksikal;ungkapan;ukpa' state='active' correction='Mi bahasa Jepangnya &quot;men&quot;.'>Mi</segment> bermakna men di <segment id='11' features='eror;ejaan;ejk' state='active' correction='Jepang' parent='7'>jepang</segment>.</segment>
Orang <segment id='13' features='eror;gramatikal;frasa-adverbia;adv0' state='active' correction='biasanya'><segment id='12' features='eror;ejaan;ejk' state='active' correction='Indonesia' parent='13'>indonesia</segment> makan</segment> mi <segment id='14' features='eror;gramatikal;frasa-preposisi;prep0' state='active' correction='dengan'>goreng <segment id='15' features='eror;ejaan;ejsp' state='active' comment='Kelebihan spasi'><segment id='16' features='eror;ejaan;ejtb' state='active' correction='sayuran, udang' parent='15'>sayuran</segment>  <segment id='17' features='eror;ejaan;ejtb' state='active' comment='Kurang tanda koma' correction='udang, dan'>udang</segment></segment> dan</segment> telur mata <segment id='19' features='eror;ejaan;ejsp' state='active' comment='Kekurangan spasi' correction='sapi. Mi'><segment id='18' features='eror;ejaan;ejsp' state='active' comment='Kelebihan spasi' correction='sapi.' parent='19'>sapi .</segment><segment id='21' features='eror;gramatikal;kalimat;kalpen' state='active' correction='Mi goreng mirip seperti yakisoba di Jepang, namun mi goreng lebih manis daripada yakisoba.'>Mi</segment> <segment id='20' features='eror;gramatikal;frasa-adjektiva;adj0' state='active' correction='mirip' parent='21'>goreng seperti</segment> yakisoba di Jepang. Mi goreng lebih manis daripada yakisoba.</segment> Saya tidak pernah makan mi goreng. <segment id='25' features='eror;ejaan;ejtb' state='active' comment='Kekurangan tanda koma'>Jadi saya</segment> mau <segment id='22' features='eror;gramatikal;frasa-verba;vrbafx' state='active' correction='memakannya'>makan</segment> <segment id='8' features='eror;gramatikal;frasa-nomina;nyaitu' state='active'>ini</segment> di <segment id='29' features='eror;ejaan;ejk' state='active' correction='Indonesia'>indonesia</segment>.
Mi goreng tidak pedas <segment id='30' features='eror;leksikal;kata;konjs' state='active' correction='sehingga'>maka</segment> <segment id='31' features='eror;ejaan;ejk' state='active' correction='orang'>Orang</segment> <segment id='32' features='eror;ejaan;ejk' state='active' correction='Jepang'>jepang</segment> bisa <segment id='33' features='eror;gramatikal;frasa-verba;vrbafx' state='active' correction='mencobanya'>coba</segment> <segment id='35' features='eror;gramatikal;frasa-nomina;nyaitu' state='active'>ini</segment>. Ayo coba makan mi goreng dengan saya.    </body>
